{"suttaId":"thag3.5","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1185,1194],"vripara":"231"},"segments":{"thag3.5:0.4":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthā","thag3.5:1.1":"“Atisītaṃ atiuṇhaṃ,","thag3.5:1.2":"atisāyamidaṃ ahu;","thag3.5:1.3":"Iti vissaṭṭhakammante,","thag3.5:1.4":"khaṇā accenti māṇave. 232.","thag3.5:2.1":"“Yo ca sītañca uṇhañca,","thag3.5:2.2":"tiṇā bhiyyo na maññati;","thag3.5:2.3":"Karaṃ purisakiccāni,","thag3.5:2.4":"so sukhā na vihāyati. 233.","thag3.5:3.1":"“Dabbaṃ kusaṃ poṭakilaṃ,","thag3.5:3.2":"usīraṃ muñjapabbajaṃ;","thag3.5:3.3":"Urasā panudissāmi,","thag3.5:3.4":"vivekamanubrūhaya”nti. …","thag3.5:3.5":"Mātaṅgaputto thero…. 6."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":4833,"to":4869,"paras":[{"para":4833,"vripara":"231","refs":["thag3.5:1"],"lines":["“Atisītaṃ atiuṇhaṃ, atisāyamidaṃ ahu;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:1"]]},{"para":4834,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:1"],"lines":["Iti vissaṭṭhakammante, khaṇā accenti māṇave. 232."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:1"]]},{"para":4836,"vripara":"232","refs":["thag3.5:2"],"lines":["“Yo ca sītañca uṇhañca, tiṇā bhiyyo na maññati;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:2"]]},{"para":4837,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:2"],"lines":["Karaṃ purisakiccāni, so sukhā na vihāyati. 233."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:2"]]},{"para":4839,"vripara":"233","refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Dabbaṃ kusaṃ poṭakilaṃ, usīraṃ muñjapabbajaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4840,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Urasā panudissāmi, vivekamanubrūhaya”nti. –","gāthāttayamāha;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4841,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Tattha <b>atisīta</b>nti himapātavaddalādinā ativiya sītaṃ, <b>idaṃ ahū</b>ti ānetvā sambandho.","<b>Atiuṇha</b>nti dhammaparitāpādinā ativiya uṇhaṃ, ubhayenapi utuvasena kosajjavatthumāha.","<b>Atisāya</b>nti divasassa pariṇatiyā atisāyaṃ, sāyaggahaṇeneva cettha pātopi saṅgayhati, tadubhayena kālavasena kosajjavatthumāha.","<b>Itī</b>ti iminā pakārena.","Etena “idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhunā kammaṃ kattabbaṃ hotī”tiādinā (a. ni. 8.80; dī. ni. 3.334) vuttaṃ kosajjavatthuṃ saṅgaṇhāti.","<b>Vissaṭṭhakammante</b>ti pariccattayogakammante.","<b>Khaṇā</b>ti buddhuppādādayo brahmacariyavāsassa okāsā.","<b>Accentī</b>ti atikkamanti.","<b>Māṇave</b>ti satte.","<b>Tiṇā bhiyyo na maññatī</b>ti tiṇato upari na maññati, tiṇaṃ viya maññati, sītuṇhāni abhibhavitvā attanā kattabbaṃ karoti.","<b>Kara</b>nti karonto.","<b>Purisakiccānī</b>ti vīrapurisena kattabbāni attahitaparahitāni.","<b>Sukhā</b>ti sukhato, nibbānasukhatoti adhippāyo.","Tatiyagāthāya attho heṭṭhā vuttoyeva."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4842,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 6."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4843,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Khujjasobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4844,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["<b>Ye cittakathī bahussutā</b>ti āyasmato khujjasobhitattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","Ayaṃ kira padumuttarassa bhagavato kāle kulagehe nibbattitvā viññutaṃ patto ekadivasaṃ bhagavantaṃ mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṃ gacchantaṃ disvā pasannamānaso dasahi gāthāhi abhitthavi.","So tena puññakammena devamanussesu saṃsaranto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde pāṭaliputtanagare brāhmaṇakule nibbatti, “sobhito”tissa nāmaṃ ahosi.","Thokaṃ khujjadhātukatāya pana <b>khujjasobhito</b>tveva paññāyittha.","So vayappatto satthari parinibbute ānandattherassa santike pabbajitvā chaḷabhiñño ahosi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 2.47.49-58) –"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4845,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Kakudhaṃ vilasantaṃva, devadevaṃ narāsabhaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4846,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Rathiyaṃ paṭipajjantaṃ, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4847,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Tamandhakāraṃ nāsetvā, santāretvā bahuṃ janaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4848,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Ñāṇālokena jotantaṃ, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4849,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Vasīsatasahassehi, nīyantaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4850,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Uddharantaṃ bahū satte, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4851,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Āhanantaṃ dhammabheriṃ, maddantaṃ titthiye gaṇe;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4852,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Sīhanādaṃ vinadantaṃ, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4853,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Yāvatā brahmalokato, āgantvāna sabrahmakā;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4854,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Pucchanti nipuṇe pañhe, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4855,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Yassañjaliṃ karitvāna, āyācanti sadevakā;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4856,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Tena puññaṃ anubhonti, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4857,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Sabbe janā samāgantvā, sampavārenti cakkhumaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4858,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Na vikampati ajjhiṭṭho, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4859,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Nagaraṃ pavisato yassa, ravanti bheriyo bahū;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4860,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Vinadanti gajā mattā, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4861,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Vīthiyā gacchato yassa, sabbābhā jotate sadā;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4862,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Abbhunnatā samā honti, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4863,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Byāharantassa buddhassa, cakkavāḷampi suyyati;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4864,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Sabbe satte viññāpeti, ko disvā na pasīdati."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4865,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ buddhamabhikittayiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4866,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, kittanāya idaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4867,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe… kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"]]},{"para":4868,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.5:3"],"lines":["Chaḷabhiñño pana hutvā paṭhamamahāsaṅgītikāle rājagahe sattapaṇṇiguhāyaṃ sannipatitena saṅghena “āyasmantaṃ ānandaṃ āmantehī”ti āṇatto pathaviyaṃ nimujjitvā therassa purato uṭṭhahitvā saṅghassa sāsanaṃ ārocetvā sayaṃ puretaraṃ ākāsena gantvā sattapaṇṇiguhādvāraṃ sampāpuṇi.","Tena ca samayena mārassa mārakāyikānañca paṭisedhanatthaṃ devasaṅghena pesitā aññatarā devatā sattapaṇṇiguhādvāre ṭhitā hoti, tassā khujjasobhito thero attano āgamanaṃ kathento – 234."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.5:3"],["thag3.5:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"before":[{"para":4790,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":4791,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Atisīta</b>nti āyasmato mātaṅgaputtattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","Ayaṃ kira padumuttarassa bhagavato kāle himavantasamīpe mahato jātassarassa heṭṭhā mahati nāgabhavane mahānubhāvo nāgarājā hutvā nibbatto ekadivasaṃ nāgabhavanato nikkhamitvā vicaranto satthāraṃ ākāsena gacchantaṃ disvā pasannamānaso attano sīsamaṇinā pūjaṃ akāsi.","So tena puññakammena devamanussesu saṃsaranto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde kosalaraṭṭhe mātaṅgassa nāma kuṭumbikassa putto hutvā nibbatto <b>mātaṅgaputto</b>tveva paññāyittha.","So viññutaṃ patto alasajātiko hutvā kiñci kammaṃ akaronto ñātakehi aññehi ca garahito “sukhajīvino ime samaṇā sakyaputtiyā”ti sukhajīvitaṃ ākaṅkhanto bhikkhūhi kataparicayo hutvā satthāraṃ upasaṅkamitvā dhammaṃ sutvā paṭiladdhasaddho pabbajitvā aññe bhikkhū iddhimante disvā iddhibalaṃ patthetvā satthu santike kammaṭṭhānaṃ gahetvā bhāvanaṃ anuyuñjanto chaḷabhiñño ahosi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 2.48.8-29) –"]},{"para":4792,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;"]},{"para":4793,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vivekakāmo sambuddho, gacchate anilañjase."]},{"para":4794,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Avidūre himavantassa, mahājātassaro ahu;"]},{"para":4795,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tattha me bhavanaṃ āsi, puññakammena saṃyutaṃ."]},{"para":4796,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Bhavanā abhinikkhamma, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;"]},{"para":4797,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Indīvaraṃva jalitaṃ, ādittaṃva hutāsanaṃ."]},{"para":4798,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Vicinaṃ naddasaṃ pupphaṃ, pūjayissanti nāyakaṃ;"]},{"para":4799,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādetvā, avandiṃ satthuno ahaṃ."]},{"para":4800,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Mama sīse maṇiṃ gayha, pūjayiṃ lokanāyakaṃ;"]},{"para":4801,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Imāya maṇipūjāya, vipāko hotu bhaddako."]},{"para":4802,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;"]},{"para":4803,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Antalikkhe ṭhito satthā, imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsatha."]},{"para":4804,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“So te ijjhatu saṅkappo, labhassu vipulaṃ sukhaṃ;"]},{"para":4805,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Imāya maṇipūjāya, anubhohi mahāyasaṃ."]},{"para":4806,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Idaṃ vatvāna bhagavā, jalajuttamanāmako;"]},{"para":4807,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Agamāsi buddhaseṭṭho, yattha cittaṃ paṇīhitaṃ."]},{"para":4808,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Saṭṭhikappāni devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ;"]},{"para":4809,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Anekasatakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ."]},{"para":4810,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Pubbakammaṃ sarantassa, devabhūtassa me sato;"]},{"para":4811,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Maṇi nibbattate mayhaṃ, ālokakaraṇo mamaṃ."]},{"para":4812,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Chaḷasītisahassāni, nāriyo me pariggahā;"]},{"para":4813,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vicittavatthābharaṇā, āmukkamaṇikuṇḍalā."]},{"para":4814,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Aḷārapamhā hasulā, susaññā tanumajjhimā;"]},{"para":4815,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Parivārenti maṃ niccaṃ, maṇipūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":4816,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Soṇṇamayā maṇimayā, lohitaṅkamayā tathā;"]},{"para":4817,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Bhaṇḍā me sukatā honti, yadicchasi piḷandhanā."]},{"para":4818,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kūṭāgārā gahā rammā, sayanañca mahārahaṃ;"]},{"para":4819,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Mama saṅkappamaññāya, nibbattanti yadicchakaṃ."]},{"para":4820,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Lābhā tesaṃ suladdhañca, ye labhanti upassutiṃ;"]},{"para":4821,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Puññakkhettaṃ manussānaṃ, osadhaṃ sabbapāṇinaṃ."]},{"para":4822,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Mayhampi sukataṃ kammaṃ, yohaṃ adakkhi nāyakaṃ;"]},{"para":4823,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vinipātā pamuttomhi, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ."]},{"para":4824,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Yaṃ yaṃ yonūpapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;"]},{"para":4825,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Divasañceva rattiñca, āloko hoti me sadā."]},{"para":4826,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tāyeva maṇipūjāya, anubhotvāna sampadā;"]},{"para":4827,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ñāṇāloko mayā diṭṭho, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ."]},{"para":4828,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ maṇiṃ abhipūjayiṃ;"]},{"para":4829,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, maṇipūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":4830,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe… kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti."]},{"para":4831,"vripara":null,"title":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Chaḷabhiñño pana hutvā puggalādhiṭṭhānavasena kosajjaṃ garahanto attano ca vīriyārambhaṃ kittento – 231."]}],"after":[{"para":4870,"vripara":"234","title":"Khujjasobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ye cittakathī bahussutā, samaṇā pāṭaliputtavāsino;"]},{"para":4871,"vripara":null,"title":"Khujjasobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tesaññataroyamāyuvā, dvāre tiṭṭhati khujjasobhito”ti. –","paṭhamaṃ gāthamāha;"]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
